// Service_Feature — Feature Service Layer (layanan, tanpa alat)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Service_Feature".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Service_Feature.png
// Acuan: fig:service-feature (Subbab IV.2.3, subsec:rincian-kelompok);
//   rincian bebas-tool kelompok baris 4 Tabel layanan_industri, komponen verbatim
//   (feature store offline dan online).
// Sumber edge: googlecloud2024mlops dan salama2021practitioners (feature
//   repository melayani pelatihan secara batch dan inferensi online),
//   kreuzberger2023mlops (feature store system).
// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Sumber data fitur (batas)
Data Storage Layer [icon: database, color: green, label: "Data Storage Layer"]

Feature Service Layer [icon: package, color: green] {
  offline feature store [icon: package]
  online feature store [icon: zap]
}

// Konsumen fitur (batas)
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer (pelatihan dan inferensi)"]

// Alur fitur (googlecloud2024mlops, salama2021practitioners)
Data Storage Layer > offline feature store: sumber data fitur
offline feature store > online feature store: materialisasi
offline feature store > Model Lifecycle Layer: fitur pelatihan batch
online feature store > Model Lifecycle Layer: fitur inferensi latensi rendah
